{"type":"npc","name":"Cascadian","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":150,"temp":0,"max":150,"details":""},"ac":{"value":26,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":20},{"type":"swim","value":20}],"details":"earth glide"},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["fey","petran","thalassic"],"details":""},"level":{"value":8},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>When a wrathful earth elemental strays through a random waterfall, there's a slight chance that the crashing waters will soothe their drive to break trees and bones and cause them to cease their rampage. And should the elemental choose to linger in the calming water for an extended period of time, the crashing waves will slowly erode their hard exterior, peeling away layers of earth and granting the elemental greater insight into the water's essence, transforming their very nature into something new.</p><p>Cascadians spend much of their time in a meditative trance, emerging for brief periods to walk the forest, feel the rain, and watch fairies dance with fireflies. They laconically engage druids and nymphs that seek their grains of insight, and local villagers need not fear the cascadian so long as they respect nature. A cascadian might even help wandering travelers that stop by their waterfall.</p><h2>Give a Hoot</h2><p>Although cascadians are gentle by nature, if one is found polluting a cascadian's waters, it stirs their wrath into something mighty, and their calm demeanor can quickly transform into searing rage. While younger cascadians are more likely to respond with immediate violence, older ones are more likely to assess the situation first, lying low and gathering strength until they can coordinate their allies for a dedicated strike.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 64/140/250 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (heavy), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Lore [River], Nature, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, constitution, earth, earth armor, elongating, energy resistant (vitality), mind, mind shield, sensory (darkvision), strength, throwing, water, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Adam","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":1},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":0},"wis":{"mod":4},"cha":{"mod":0}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":16,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"tremorsense","acuity":"imprecise","range":60},{"type":"wavesense","acuity":"imprecise","range":60}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":13},"athletics":{"base":18},"nature":{"base":16},"stealth":{"base":13}},"traits":{"value":["amphibious","earth","elemental","water"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"emlbedHMQ2JOFeZh","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/cascadian.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Cascadian","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/cascadian.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"b