rsion":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["brutal","range-increment-60"]},"damageRolls":{"EV40GEnyVZx9GTde":{"damage":"1d10+10","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":20},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"BMTUknbVFXFFGKBH","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Attune With Nature","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The cascadian is in contact with both water and solid ground</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cascadian enhances their attunement to the world around them. While attuned, they are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, but they gain lifesense 60 feet, and the ranges of their tremorsense and wavesense increase to 200 feet. The attunement remains active until the cascadian Dismisses it.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":3},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"ljPW4IdLbqf72W25","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Share Enlightenment","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The cascadian is Attuned with Nature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cascadian shares their attunement all creatures within 30 feet (@Check[will|dc:26] save negates). A willing creature can choose to receive the results of a failure.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round and gains tremorsense (imprecise) 30 feet and wavesense (imprecise) 30 feet while it is immobilized.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round, and gains tremorsense (imprecise) 60 feet and wavesense (imprecise) 60 feet while it is paralyzed.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the paralysis lasts for 4 rounds. The creature can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns to reduce the remaining duration by 1 round, or end it entirely on a critical success.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"v4iYxElVddglxYwg","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Earth Glide","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The Cascadian can Burrow through dirt and stone at their full burrow Speed, leaving no tunnels or signs of their passing.